predictions for prediction markets\",\"url\":\"https://www.alphascope.app\",\"description\":\"AI-powered prediction-market trading assistant for Polymarket, Kalshi, and Manifold. Get probability forecasts, news-impact analysis, and live market odds.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.alphascope.app/#website\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.alphascope.app/#organization\"},\"image\":\"https://www.alphascope.app/alphascope-og-1500x500.png\",\"mainEntity\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.alphascope.app/#software\"}},{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"@id\":\"https://www.alphascope.app/#software\",\"name\":\"Alphascope\",\"url\":\"https://www.alphascope.app\",\"description\":\"AI-powered prediction-market trading assistant for Polymarket, Kalshi, and Manifold.\",\"applicationCategory\":\"FinanceApplication\",\"applicationSubCategory\":\"Prediction Market Research Tool\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires JavaScript in a modern web browser.\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":true,\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":0,\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.alphascope.app/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.alphascope.app/#webpage\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"15:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$1e\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"markets\":[{\"id\":\"ed65b7ea-ae56-4ce8-80dd-77cbdff8ea99\",\"platform\":\"polymarket\",\"probability\":0.02,\"slug\":\"democratic-presidential-nominee-2028\",\"seoSlug\":\"democratic-presidential-nominee-2028\",\"eventSeoSlug\":\"democratic-presidential-nominee-2028\",\"title\":\"Democratic Presidential Nominee 2028\",\"liquidity\":80437770.851},{\"id\":\"3b0cd835-022f-4112-8d44-4ce03ff34f7b\",\"platform\":\"polymarket\",\"probability\":0.66,\"slug\":\"republican-presidential-nominee-2028\",\"seoSlug\":\"republican-presidential-nominee-2028\",\"eventSeoSlug\":\"republ